f any mention of data deposition in public databases, sequence identifiers, or relevant accession numbers also supports this conclusion, aligning with the paper's focus on treatment eligibility and patient-reported outcomes rather than on genetic data, leading to a definitive answer that is supported by a comprehensive analysis of the paper's content and objectives."
