36660819,6,From which countries were the sequenced samples obtained?,No sequenced samples were obtained.,"Here, we report the antiretroviral therapy as long acting suppression (ATLAS)-2M study week 152 results. ATLAS-2M is a phase 3b, randomized, multicenter study assessing the efficacy and safety of CAB+RPV LA every 8 weeks (Q8W) versus every 4 weeks (Q4W).","The paper does not mention any countries from which sequenced samples were obtained, as no samples were obtained for sequencing."
