36738248,6,From which countries were the sequenced samples obtained?,Switzerland,"The SHCS is a prospective multicentre study that is highly representative of the HIV-1 epidemic in Switzerland and includes broad, in-depth and high-quality genetic, biological, clinical and demographic data.","The paper mentions that the SHCS is a study representative of the HIV-1 epidemic in Switzerland, indicating that the sequenced samples were obtained from Switzerland."
36738248,7,From what years were the sequenced samples obtained?,2021 and earlier,"As of August 2021, the SHCS has a cumulative total of 21 529 patients. Plasma samples from PLHIV in the SHCS are collected twice per year.","The paper mentions that as of August 2021, the SHCS has a cumulative total of 21,529 patients. Plasma samples from PLHIV in the SHCS are collected twice per year. Hence the samples were collected in 2021 and earlier."
