37540331,3,Were sequences from the paper made publicly available?,No,"This study was registered at the Iranian Registry of Clinical Trials (IRCT20191005044984N1, registered at 2019–12-21) and conducted as an open-label randomized non-inferiority trial. HIV-positive adults (≥ 18 years old) who were on ART, with undetectable viral load (HIV-RNA < 47 copies/mL), and CD4 > 200 cells/µL in the past two years were enrolled.",The paper does not mention any publicly available sequences from the study.
