ve children without history of enfuvirtide, raltegravir dolutegravir effective concentration 0.1-10 umol/L or 0.08-0.064 umol/L not executed. Exclusion criteria included documented resistance to abacavir, dolutegravir, or lamivudine (except M184V);","The paper does not mention any specific HIV genes that were sequenced. It focuses on the pharmacokinetics, safety, and tolerability of antiretroviral treatments in children with HIV, and there is no indication of such data being reported. The study focuses on the pharmacokinetics and safety of a new drug regimen in children with HIV, and does not include data on sequencing of HIV samples from individuals."
