37674678,11,What type of samples were sequenced?,Plasma samples,"Within 12 h after blood collection, plasma was isolated and kept at −80°C until analysis. Viral RNA was extracted from 200 μl plasma samples using the QIAamp Viral RNA Mini Kit (Qiagen, Hilden, Germany).",The paper mentions that plasma samples were collected and used for viral RNA extraction and subsequent sequencing.
